---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How ExFu handles the information you send through this website."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap reading-layout">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow red">Your information</p><h1>Privacy.</h1><p class="privacy-updated">
          Updated 8 September 2026
        </p>
      </div><div class="prose">
        <h2>Who handles your enquiry</h2><p>
          ExFu is a trading name of WhaleyBear Ltd. Alastair Brayne handles enquiries. You can
          contact me at <a href="mailto:al@exfu.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >al@exfu.ai</a
          > about your information.
        </p><h2>What this website collects</h2><p>
          When you send an enquiry, the form collects your name, email address, selected type of
          support and the message you submit. If you use the quiz, it creates an editable summary in
          your browser. Quiz answers are sent only when you submit the enquiry and include them in
          your message.
        </p><p>
          The site does not add advertising cookies or use marketing analytics. The hosting provider
          may process technical information, such as IP addresses and request logs, to deliver and
          protect the website.
        </p><h2>What happens to an enquiry</h2><p>
          Your details are used to respond to your request and discuss potential work. They are not
          added to a marketing mailing list by this form. Please avoid including passwords,
          sensitive client material or other information that is not needed for an initial
          conversation.
        </p><p>
          The website and form are hosted by Netlify. Submitted enquiries are processed and stored
          through Netlify Forms, and may be delivered to my email as a notification. These service
          providers may process data outside the UK. See <a
            href="https://www.netlify.com/privacy/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer">Netlify’s privacy policy</a
          > for its practices.
        </p><h2>Keeping and removing information</h2><p>
          Enquiry information is kept for responding to you and any related discussion about working
          together. If you want to ask what information is held, correct it or request its deletion,
          email <a href="mailto:al@exfu.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">al@exfu.ai</a
          >. If we work together, any additional handling of business or client information will be
          agreed as part of the engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .privacy-updated {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .prose h2:not(:first-child) {
    margin-top: 48px;
  }
</style>
